OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash that shuts
OL,4,AOrwell Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a collision
OL,7,Fthat has closed a major route in
OL,8,FSuffolk.
OL,10,FPolice were called by paramedics to the
OL,11,FOrwell Bridge, which carries the A14
OL,12,Fsouth of Ipswich, at 03:41 BST, after
OL,13,Freports of a person in the westbound
OL,14,Fcarriageway.
OL,16,FThe man, who has not yet been
OL,17,Fidentified, was pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
