OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash that shuts
OL,4,AOrwell Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A14 has been shut in both
OL,7,Fdirections between junction 56 for
OL,8,FWherstead and junction 57 at the Nacton
OL,9,Finterchange while investigations
OL,10,Fcontinue.
